<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota Direct Hog actual receipts for Friday were 100,000 head and Saturday's actual were 21,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales barrows and gilts steady to weak compared to mid-session Friday.</p>
<p>US 1-3 46-49% Carcass Base Lean*   Country	  Plants</p>
<p>	 220-260 lbs		 53.50-55.00    54.50 -56.00</p>
<p>	  few			  52.50-53.00    53.50 -54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	     43.00 -46.00     44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.	     48.00 -51.00     49.00 -51.00</p>
<p>	 500 lbs. up		53.00 -60.00     54.00 -62.00</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
